      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それなら、駅に着く前に\r\n飛び降りるのが得策です。",
        "official_en": "Jumping off beforehand would be our best plan of action, statistically speaking.",
        "real_en": "If so, our best option is to jump off before we reach the station."
